  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC Mozambique 2025 Appeal  - The &#x201c;ICRC Mozambique 2025 Appeal&#x201d; aims to respond to the consequences of the armed conflict and natural shocks in the northern part of the country, by assisting people affected in meeting their basic needs. It promotes respect for IHL, other applicable norms and humanitarian principles, particularly in relation to protection of people affected by conflict and violence. Assistance will enable people to restore contact with their families, ensure they have access to water, health care and other essential services, provides livelihood and emergency support, and visits to detainees to monitor their treatment and living conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
